  <!--EN: We can still hear the mesmerizing words of the cap'n, as they reminded us of the importance of our shared camaraderie. We can even feel our sadness vanish away.-->
  <VFEP_AmazingShanties.stages.0.description>船长的那番话语令我们久久不能忘怀，他再次提醒了我们兄弟间的情谊有多么重要。我们心中的悲痛似乎也随之消散了。</VFEP_AmazingShanties.stages.0.description>
  <!--EN: amazing singing shanties-->
  <VFEP_AmazingShanties.stages.0.label>令人惊异的水手欢歌</VFEP_AmazingShanties.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: The cap'n displayed a lack of passion and the feeling of camaraderie just wasn't there.-->
  <VFEP_BoringShanties.stages.0.description>船长一直拿我们当小屁孩看，我们唱的水手之歌也不够振奋人心。</VFEP_BoringShanties.stages.0.description>
  <!--EN: boring singing shanties-->
  <VFEP_BoringShanties.stages.0.label>无聊的水手欢歌</VFEP_BoringShanties.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: We’ve lost one of ours. I need to look to others for strength.-->
  <VFEP_Camaraderie_Exalted_CrewDead.stages.0.description>我们失去了一名好兄弟。或许我们应该相互鼓励以走出悲伤。</VFEP_Camaraderie_Exalted_CrewDead.stages.0.description>
