  <!--EN: The cap'n treated us like children, wanting so desperately to hear something to lift their spirits.-->
  <VFEP_LameShanties.stages.0.description>船长毫无激情，这根本无法增进我们间的兄弟情谊。</VFEP_LameShanties.stages.0.description>
  <!--EN: lame singing shanties-->
  <VFEP_LameShanties.stages.0.label>乏味的水手欢歌</VFEP_LameShanties.stages.0.label>
  <!--EN: Shiver me timbers, those were some good shanties! The cap'n lifted our spirits and made us feel a camaraderie and togetherness that will only make us stronger.-->
  <VFEP_RousingShanties.stages.0.description>我们唱的水手之歌十分美妙！船长的鼓舞激励了我们，我们将同甘共苦，攻克难关！</VFEP_RousingShanties.stages.0.description>
  <!--EN: rousing singing shanties-->
  <VFEP_RousingShanties.stages.0.label>振奋人心的水手欢歌</VFEP_RousingShanties.stages.0.label>
